## 1. Purpose

This policy sets how Contoso Demo Bank values collateral for credit decisions.

## 2. Scope

Applies to residential mortgages, CRE, and inventory-secured SME facilities.

## 3. Thresholds

- Residential appraisal maximum age is {{ facts.residential_appraisal_max_age }}.
- An AVM is allowed only if LTV is ≤ {{ facts.avm_max_ltv }} and the loan is ≤ {{ facts.avm_max_loan }}.
- CRE valuation maximum age is {{ facts.cre_valuation_max_age }}.
- Inventory collateral haircut is {{ facts.inventory_collateral_haircut }}.
- A licensed appraiser is required above the AVM threshold.

## 4. Authority

Valuation exceptions follow Exceptions and Override (CP-EXC-2026-01).

## 5. Related policies

See Residential Mortgage (CP-RML-2026-01) and Commercial Real Estate (CP-CRE-2026-01).
